Issue Analysis
The current implementation of is_invalid_id may not be correctly identifying all invalid IDs, especially for cases like 1188511885 (which is 11885 repeated twice).
Fix
The function should check if the ID is composed of a sequence of digits repeated exactly twice, not just any number of times. For example:

11 is 1 repeated twice.
123123 is 123 repeated twice.
